          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gutyo, igihe cose Aroni azoba yinjiye Ahera, azoba yambaye amazina y’imiryango ya Isirayeli ku mutima wiwe nk’icibutso kizohoraho imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bazoshire Urimu na Tumimu imbere muri uwo mufuko, kugira ngo bize bibe ku mutima wa Aroni igihe cose azoba yinjiye imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Gutyo Aroni azokwama yambaye ibimenyetso vyo kwuzuriza Abisirayeli igihe cose azoba arengutse imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
